# The build context is the repo root; only what the image needs goes in.
*
!relay/
!deploy/entrypoint.sh
!deploy/web/
# The game server runs res://server/main.tscn, and nothing it loads is in
# client/ (game/tests/dependencies_test.gd), so the client and its assets stay
# out.
!game/project.godot
!game/server/
!game/sim/
!game/net/
!game/shared/
